    lessonPlan: '0–4 Retrieve Chapter 12 and predict; 4–10 Listen and raise hands at “Suddenly”, then read along; 10–17 Timeline in pairs (wavy line / arrow) and the four-step chain water → famous → people came → city, whole-class check with sentences from the text; 17–21 Quick Challenge; 21–30 Language Focus: Activity 1 as whole-class discovery (long action or moment?), Activity 2 in pairs (Why because here and because of there?), Activity 3 with a quick vote; 30–37 Use: “Suddenly” stories, learners tell a partner about a surprising moment (I was doing my homework. Suddenly, …) and write four sentences, two volunteers read; 37–40 Exit ticket.',
